<title>USA: Southwest Airlines Nov load factor rises.</title>
<headline>Southwest Airlines Nov load factor rises.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996		  1995</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     64.0		61.5</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   2,170.5	   1,908.9</p>
<p> Available seat miles	3,391.8	   3,103.2</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent     66.4		64.5</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles   24,707.8	  21,303.5</p>
<p> Available seat miles	37,222.0	  33,007.1</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Year-to-date same as one month.</p>
<p>Full company name is Southwest Airlines Co</p>
